docs {
  ### User Signup - Username Already Taken
  Attempts to register using a username that is already taken by another account.
  
  #### Response (400 Bad Request)
  ```json
  {
    "statusCode": 400,
    "message": "Username already taken",
    "error": "Bad Request"
  }
  ```
}
